<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 1996 asset sales reach 5.601 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine 1996 asset sales reach 5.601 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines generated 5.601 billion pesos from the sale of state assets last year, the finance department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The amount was below the 21.5 billion peso target due to delays in the sale of the Food Terminal Inc, the sequestered shares of Manila Electric Co and a property in the Ortigas business district.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
